<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 6 October <span class="n">8</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/charles-the-bald"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/charles-the-bald.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Charles the Bald</span><span class="tp">823–877</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/joan-ii-of-navarre"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/joan-ii-of-navarre.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Joan II of Navarre</span><span class="tp">1312–1349</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jeong-do-jeon"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jeong-do-jeon.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Jeong Do-jeon</span><span class="tp">1342–1398</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/william-i-count-of-nassau-siegen"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/william-i-count-of-nassau-siegen.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">William I, Count of Nassau-Siegen</span><span class="tp">1487–1559</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/charles-emmanuel-iv-of-sardinia"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/charles-emmanuel-iv-of-sardinia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Charles Emmanuel IV of Sardinia</span><span class="tp">1751–1819</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/charles-stewart-parnell"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/charles-stewart-parnell.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Charles Stewart Parnell</span><span class="tp">1846–1891</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/anwar-sadat"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/anwar-sadat.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Anwar Sadat</span><span class="tp">1918–1981</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/arpad-goncz"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/arpad-goncz.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Árpád Göncz</span><span class="tp">1922–2015</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
